> Paula Anderson was certified[ as a] Master Clinical Hypn[other]apist in 2000 and immediately opened her private practice. Prior to that she received her BFA in Cello Performance and was a professional musician. Since 2000 she has participated in several advanced and cutting-edge trainings and seminars, always with an intention of deepening her understanding of human experience and consciousness. All of this informs her work and the consciousness and respect she brings to her sessions.[][][][][][][][]

