> Dr Harry D. Vild[ibill] was born in Tampa FL and raised in Brandon, FL[.] He attended Vanderbilt University and University of South Carolina, School of Medicine. He completed his general surgery residency at Mayo Graduate School of Medicine, Mayo Clinic, Rochester, MN. Dr Vilidbill has been in practice since 1998. Dr Vildibill is married with 2 children.
