This year 2019[, Mewar Mahots]av will be celebrated from 8th April to 10[th] April[.] Day 1[ of the] festival will have the royal Gang[aur processions which] will[ go] upt[o] Gangaur G[hat]. There will be loads of[ cultural] programmes[ for] 3 days[.] A rural[ ha]at[ b]azaar will also be an attraction in this[ festive] season[.]

